    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41873" root="ورس" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَرْسِىٌّ</span></b>  A <i>yellow</i> bowl: (A:) or a bowl <i>made
of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُضَار</span>, (M,) which is a yellow wood: (TA:)
or <i>of the best kind of those made of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُضَار</span>. (Lth,
K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  A pigeon that is <i>red inclining to yellowness:</i> (M:) or a pigeon <i>inclining to redness and
yellowness.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَرِيسٌ</span>.

